    "quantifiers": [
      "For every finite vertex type in any universe and every such triangulation homeomorphism; construct finite K, a vertex v, and a subcomplex B containing v.",
      "For every natural degree n including zero, the actual reduced rational singular homology of Realization K is zero."
    ],
    "domains": [
      "K is the explicit two-cone precomplex after the proved finite-coordinate relabeling when necessary; B is the actual closed edge from the chosen pole to a vertex derived from nonempty Realization L.",
