    ],
    "conclusions": [
      "Nonempty and contractible punctured K; B ≤ K and v ∈ B; actual punctured-edge inclusion is a homotopy equivalence.",
      "An explicit integer linear equivalence H₂(Realization K;ℤ) ≃ₗ[ℤ] ZMod 2.",
      "All reduced rational homology groups vanish, and Realization K is not contractible."
    ],
    "representation": [
      "The antipodal quotient of the actual Euclidean unit sphere is the RP² target of the triangulation homeomorphism. Its singular homology is obtained through the borrowed cellular/singular comparison and proven cellular differential calculation.",
